  {
   "id": "e97241752",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 1464.375,
   "width": 434,
   "height": 81.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1373778862,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1641865964,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "D. No se valida el stock al vender\nNi el front ni la base impiden cantidad > stock.\ncopy puede quedar negativo.\nVentasScanner.jsx:277 calcula stock con cantidad_docenas\n(original) - SUM(ventas), no con copy.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 11,
   "containerId": "e92552551",
   "originalText": "D. No se valida el stock al vender\nNi el front ni la base impiden cantidad > stock.\ncopy puede quedar negativo.\nVentasScanner.jsx:277 calcula stock con cantidad_docenas\n(original) - SUM(ventas), no con copy.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e46006753",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 480,
   "y": 1418,
   "width": 630,
   "height": 174,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1089953485,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1834589061,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "e41232554",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e41232554",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 488,
   "y": 1431.875,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 146.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 138455866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 910503579,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Base de datos (regla central):\n  ALTER TABLE entradas ADD CONSTRAINT chk_copy_no_neg\n    CHECK (cant_docenas_copy >= 0) NOT VALID;\n  Si el UPDATE del trigger viola el CHECK, falla todo el INSERT\n  (atomicidad) y la venta no se guarda.\nFrontend: en VentasScanner.jsx:277 usar\n  total = Number(entrada.cant_docenas_copy ?? entrada.cantidad_docenas)\n  y bloquear/avisar si qty > total.\nCapturar el error en confirmSale (hoy hace catch genérico).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 11,
   "containerId": "e46006753",
   "originalText": "Base de datos (regla central):\n  ALTER TABLE entradas ADD CONSTRAINT chk_copy_no_neg\n    CHECK (cant_docenas_copy >= 0) NOT VALID;\n  Si el UPDATE del trigger viola el CHECK, falla todo el INSERT\n  (atomicidad) y la venta no se guarda.\nFrontend: en VentasScanner.jsx:277 usar\n  total = Number(entrada.cant_docenas_copy ?? entrada.cantidad_docenas)\n  y bloquear/avisar si qty > total.\nCapturar el error en confirmSale (hoy hace catch genérico).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e16361155",
